sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Client as JurisDigta client
  participant STT as Speech recognition adapter
  participant Intake as Request intake / intent router
  participant Catalog as Capability catalog (proposed)
  participant Policy as Policy gateway (proposed)
  participant Executor as Execution orchestrator (proposed)
  participant ORSR as ORSR adapter / official service
  participant Local as Browser directory search (proposed)
  participant Audit as Authorization/audit store

  User->>Client: Start microphone and speak one request
  Client->>STT: Active audio segment, locale, disclosed mode
  alt Remote STT lacks applicable consent
    STT-->>Client: Block remote upload; offer genuine local/typed fallback
    Client-->>User: Explain fallback; execute nothing
  else Recognition permitted
    STT-->>Client: Transcript and confidence metadata
    Client-->>User: Show editable transcript
    User->>Client: Review/edit and submit normalized text
    Client->>Intake: Reviewed text, context, correlation/idempotency key
    alt Question
      Intake-->>Client: Route through existing question/chat path
      Client-->>User: Show reviewable answer and limitations
    else Ambiguous or unsupported
      Intake-->>Client: Clarification or unsupported result
      Client-->>User: Ask focused question or offer typed/manual path
    else Candidate command
      Intake->>Catalog: Find eligible versioned capabilities
      Catalog-->>Intake: Schema, destination, permissions, risk, confirmation policy
      Intake-->>Client: Structured execution preview; no authority yet
      Client-->>User: Show capability, data, destination, scope, side effects
      alt User cancels or required scope is absent
        User->>Client: Cancel / decline
        Client->>Policy: Optional redacted cancellation event
        Policy->>Audit: Record denial/cancellation metadata
        Client-->>User: Keep or discard editable draft; execute nothing
      else User confirms exact proposal
        User->>Client: Confirm and grant required scope
        Client->>Policy: Proposal, confirmation, scope, identity, versions
        Policy->>Catalog: Revalidate capability and policy versions
        alt Authorization invalid, expired, replayed, or changed
          Policy->>Audit: Record redacted denial reason
          Policy-->>Client: Denied; require new preview
          Client-->>User: Explain denial; execute nothing
        else Authorized
          Policy->>Audit: Record authorization metadata
          Policy-->>Client: Authorized exact proposal + expiry
          alt ORSR company verification
            Client->>Executor: Authorized structured request + idempotency key
            Executor->>ORSR: Minimum company name/IČO
            ORSR-->>Executor: Sourced zero/one/multiple match or error
            Executor->>Audit: Record status, versions, timing, provenance
            Executor-->>Client: Result/error and non-executing related suggestions
          else Session-scoped contract filename search
            Client->>Local: User-selected folder + filename/metadata query
            Local-->>Client: Minimal matches or browser permission/error
            Client->>Audit: Record privacy-minimized local outcome metadata
          end
          Client-->>User: Show outcome, source, limitations, human-review step
        end
      end
    end
  end
